          'A two by two grid whose rows are steady and unsteady and whose columns are uniform and non-uniform. Each cell holds a small animated example: constant flow in a constant-bore pipe, constant flow in a tapering pipe, a valve being opened in a constant-bore pipe, and a valve being opened in a tapering pipe. Beside the grid, two probes are drawn, one fixed in space with a time trace beside it testing steadiness and one sliding along the pipe with a distance trace testing uniformity. A separate frame-of-reference panel shows a ship from the shore and from the deck with the flow labelled differently in each. On reveal: the grid draws empty, each cell animates in turn, the two probes appear and produce their traces, then the ship panel switches viewpoint.',
