        visualSpec:
          'A five rung ladder rising from the bottom of the frame, each rung labelled with a module and annotated with the assumption it discarded and the capability that unlocked. Beside each rung a small representative problem is drawn: a dam gate, a flow net, a venturi, an aerofoil and a nozzle. A decision flowchart runs alongside asking in sequence whether the fluid is moving, whether forces are needed, whether the body is immersed and whether the Mach number exceeds 0.3, routing to the appropriate rung. On reveal: the ladder builds rung by rung with each assumption striking through as it is discarded and each capability appearing, the example problems attach, then the decision flowchart runs a sample problem down its branches to land on a rung.',
